Test Case Type:
API Quote Eligibility Checks Reconciliation

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that the total API Quote Eligibility Checks reconcile to the sum of API Quote Accepted, Referred and Declined outcomes for each application decision date.

Expected Results:
API Quote Eligibility Checks should equal:
API Quote Accepted
+ API Quote Referred
+ API Quote Declined.

There should be zero difference between the total API quote count and the sum of the three quote outcome buckets.

